{"seq":10,"slug":"party-self-revolution","title":"党的自我革命","stage":"DONE","category":"xi-jinping-thought","categoryLabel":"习近平思想","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/party-self-revolution","rating":{"composite":3.7,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/03_xi-jinping-thought/10_party-self-revolution","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"党的自我革命-简介\">党的自我革命 简介</h1><p>党的自我革命是习近平关于全面从严治党的核心理论命题，揭示了中国共产党跳出历史周期率的&quot;第二个答案&quot;。本知识库从<strong>理论基础、制度机制、实践评估</strong>三个维度，系统梳理新时代党的建设的理论创新与实践深化，回答三个层层递进的问题：自我革命<strong>是什么、为什么</strong>（理论），<strong>靠什么落地</strong>（制度），<strong>成效与走向如何</strong>（实践）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>本 hub 聚焦&quot;党自身如何自我净化、自我完善&quot;这一<strong>党的建设</strong>主题。它与习近平思想体系内相邻 hub 既有交集又各有侧重，阅读时建议按下表区分边界，避免重复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>关注核心</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>本 hub·党的自我革命</td>\n<td>党的自我净化、反腐败、政治生态、党内法规</td>\n<td>主体是&quot;管党治党&quot;，落点在党自身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../xi-jinping-thought-overview/\">习近平思想总览</a></td>\n<td>思想体系的整体框架（八个明确、十四个坚持）</td>\n<td>提供理论母体；本 hub 是其&quot;党建&quot;分支的展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../rule-of-law/\">依法治国</a></td>\n<td>国家法律体系、监察立法、司法改革</td>\n<td>&quot;纪法贯通&quot;中&quot;法&quot;的一侧；本 hub 主&quot;纪&quot;与&quot;规&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../comprehensive-deepening-reform/\">全面深化改革</a></td>\n<td>经济、财税、国企等领域的体制改革</td>\n<td>改革覆盖各领域；党建改革只是其中一支，本 hub 专攻这一支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../governance-of-china/\">治国理政（著作）</a></td>\n<td>以《习近平谈治国理政》文本为线索的导读</td>\n<td>文本/语录导向；本 hub 是问题/制度导向的专题分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：<strong>总览</strong>给框架，<strong>本 hub</strong>给党建专题，<strong>依法治国</strong>给国法一侧，<strong>全面深化改革</strong>给其余领域改革，<strong>治国理政</strong>给文本入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><p>整体顺序遵循&quot;理论→制度→实践&quot;，但不同读者可按需取舍：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>党政干部 / 纪检监察工作者</strong>：制度机制章（第二章）为重点起点——先读<a href=\"institutional-mechanism/anti-corruption-system\">反腐败体制机制</a>与<a href=\"institutional-mechanism/inspection-tour\">巡视巡察制度</a>掌握运行体系，再回看<a href=\"theoretical-foundation/party-discipline\">党纪党规</a>夯实规范依据，最后读<a href=\"practice-assessment/party-building-challenges\">党建面临的挑战</a>对照工作实际。</li>\n<li><strong>政治学 / 党建专业师生</strong>：按章序通读。从<a href=\"theoretical-foundation/self-revolution-concept\">自我革命概念</a>与<a href=\"theoretical-foundation/historical-periodical-rate\">历史周期率问题</a>建立理论坐标，再进入制度与实践两章，结合<a href=\"../xi-jinping-thought-overview/theoretical-significance/governing-party-theory\">执政党理论</a>做理论延伸。</li>\n<li><strong>关注中国政治的一般读者</strong>：可从实践评估章切入——<a href=\"practice-assessment/anti-corruption-achievement\">反腐败成就评估</a>用数据与案例直观呈现成效，再向前追溯理论与制度，兴趣驱动、由果及因。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>阅读本 hub 几乎不需要专门门槛，但具备以下背景会更顺畅：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>了解中国共产党的基本组织架构（党章、党代会、中央纪委国家监委等机构）；</li>\n<li>对十八大以来的反腐败大事件有概括印象（八项规定、监察体制改革、巡视全覆盖）；</li>\n<li>若对习近平思想整体框架陌生，建议先浏览<a href=\"../xi-jinping-thought-overview/\">习近平思想总览</a>再读本 hub，理论定位会更清晰。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"theoretical-foundation","title":"理论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/party-self-revolution/theoretical-foundation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"self-revolution-concept","title":"自我革命概念","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/party-self-revolution/theoretical-foundation/self-revolution-concept"},{"seq":2,"slug":"historical-periodical-rate","title":"历史周期率问题","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/party-self-revolution/theoretical-foundation/historical-periodical-rate"},{"seq":3,"slug":"party-discipline","title":"党纪党规","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/party-self-revolution/theoretical-foundation/party-discipline"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"institutional-mechanism","title":"制度机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/party-self-revolution/institutional-mechanism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"anti-corruption-system","title":"反腐败体制机制","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/party-self-revolution/institutional-mechanism/anti-corruption-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inspection-tour","title":"巡视巡察制度","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/party-self-revolution/institutional-mechanism/inspection-tour"},{"seq":3,"slug":"political-ecology","title":"政治生态建设","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/party-self-revolution/institutional-mechanism/political-ecology"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"practice-assessment","title":"实践评估","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/party-self-revolution/practice-assessment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"anti-corruption-achievement","title":"反腐败成就评估","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/party-self-revolution/practice-assessment/anti-corruption-achievement"},{"seq":2,"slug":"party-building-challenges","title":"党建面临的挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/party-self-revolution/practice-assessment/party-building-challenges"},{"seq":3,"slug":"future-prospect","title":"未来展望","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/party-self-revolution/practice-assessment/future-prospect"}]}]}